abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived per-sample records for the manuscript on
  candidate-spread uncertainty in physics-informed generative field
  reconstruction. The archive reproduces the width-ratio, coverage, paired
  intervention, permutation and held-out-domain analyses without retraining;
  the full training/inference entry points are included for provenance.
